WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.120
- And your wife, Abby, I just
noticed. In the audience.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.310
Yes. And your kids are new
to Southern California.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.370
Y'all just moved here.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:06.320
How is it?

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.820
- It's amazing, we love LA, so much.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.565
- Yeah! Well, welcome to We
Love LA week. That's fitting.

00:00:10.565 --> 00:00:12.700
- Thank you, I know, it's perfect.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.190
- So what's the most LA thing
that you've gotten into?

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.960
- Well, for the first week,

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.130
our new neighbors started
dropping little gifts off

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.970
on our stairs. It was so sweet.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.250
Just welcome to the neighborhood.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.083
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:26.916
- And my kids kept saying

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:28.750
they keep giving us these pretty rocks.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.050
And we started having
pretty rocks all over.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.690
They're crystals apparently.

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.130
- [Kelly] Yes, you get a lot of-

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.330
- This is a very LA thing.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.400
You have crystals. I
don't know what they are,

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.233
but they're pretty.

00:00:38.233 --> 00:00:39.850
- You charge them with the moon,

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.160
I don't know if you've heard.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.330
- Okay, so I'm not there yet.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.140
- Put them outside. No,
I know, I'm telling you,

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:44.973
this happens to me too.

00:00:44.973 --> 00:00:46.230
I've got, that's the gift,

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.650
I think a lot of people
give out here. Yeah.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:48.680
- [Woman] Pretty rocks, yeah.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:49.660
- Well, but they are pretty.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.110
And here's the thing. If
it works or not, I'm down.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:52.943
- I'll take it all.

00:00:52.943 --> 00:00:53.790
I need all the help I can get.

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.510
- If it works or not, I'm like, sure.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:56.830
I'll put it in the moon and charge it.

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:57.790
Just wear it on my body.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.270
- Tish had a headache
the other day and I said,

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:02.174
just put this by your head.

00:01:02.174 --> 00:01:03.199
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:04.290
- [Kelly] Did it work?

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.389
- No, we needed Advil, yeah.

00:01:05.389 --> 00:01:06.222
(Kelly laughs)

